KeenInsight

The MIT grant covers the original integration, application, deployment,
tests and documentation in this source release. It does not relicense the
external projects against which integration patches are supplied.

DREAM, RCRank and original SysInsight/WorkloadTune code, PostgreSQL sources,
FlameGraph, monitoring distributions, training data and pretrained weights
are external dependencies. Their names and pinned source identities are
recorded for attribution and reproducibility. They are not bundled here.

The release does not assert a license grant for upstream sources/models for
which no license was found in the audited snapshot. Obtaining a public
download is not, by itself, a redistribution grant. Review the upstream
terms before distributing derived builds, datasets, weights or reference
knowledge. See docs/DEPENDENCIES.md.
